  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "This is the first standalone release of the CPU execution provider for YoloDotNet, introduced alongside the new modular architecture.\n\nThe CPU execution provider runs inference using ONNX Runtime’s built-in CPU backend and requires no additional system-level dependencies, drivers, or runtimes. It works out of the box on Windows, Linux, and macOS.\n\nThis provider is intended for development, testing, CI environments, and production scenarios where GPU or NPU acceleration is not available or required. It is fully compatible with the YoloDotNet core library and follows the new execution-provider-agnostic design.",
